Voice"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Traffic-logging","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Traffic logging"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Logging.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Warning","style":"warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"anchor":"Custo